{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "98025f55c269642fb76bd446c33131e359bda028ef3f640f76d988893b46b9ef", "ja": "（今日は、アイドル雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nスーツを着た千鶴さんは、何だか楽しそうで……）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《I‧G‧R‧A！！》的拍摄日。\n穿上套装的千鹤，看起来好像很开心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "edc5a5a5083dcd9b7415b95f00ef152513c7e1844a8e7bac4954f582e418183d", "ja": "ふふっ！　こういうスーツも、たまにはいいですわね！\n就活生になった気分ですわ♪", "zh": "呵呵！偶尔穿这种套装也不错呢！\n感觉自己好像变成求职生了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0a9bc11b4d522b64fbf560034dc2dfa9665bad4a964c7ab14b36736a9b17cbb4", "ja": "確かに、大学生のスーツというと\n就職活動を想像しますね。", "zh": "的确，说到大学生穿套装，\n就会想到求职活动呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1003_p", "source_sha256": "7446235db884d37ada98fb00e7ba2d3479afd65f88b073b8692364b6598c492c", "ja": "千鶴さんも、アイドルになる前は\n就職を考えたりしたんですか？", "zh": "千鹤在成为偶像前，\n也有考虑过找工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "b93c6fce8d379fe84cd71e7cf69623355cb307085fb8adb3ae8ade01f1e19f5e", "ja": "そうですわね……\n家の仕事を手伝う、という道もありましたけれど……。", "zh": "这个嘛……\n是有一条帮忙家业的路给本小姐选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "11e330d84f153d324650e9b9d039cdd060d62077e4982ed8b23f765abb565a98", "ja": "やはり普通に就職活動をして、\nできる限り安定した一般企業に就職……ではなく！", "zh": "不过本小姐还是想正常地求职，\n然后尽可能在稳定的一般企业工作……不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "428f929e825ece4cf4b330a6301b6dd19d3262772c020ccd48f935552a7f38c3", "ja": "その、と、特に決めてはいませんでしたわ！？", "zh": "呃，本、本小姐并没有决定要做什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1007_p", "source_sha256": "253e746ac9d9006b3326ef9f69863ae47f89a30be67ec6d047296c57df463293", "ja": "なるほど、色んな選択肢があったんですね。", "zh": "原来如此，也就是你当时有很多选择啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "64b1d88eb33047e649de60baa476815f4bb3c1bdaf80bc5986acc2a6e73fb61e", "ja": "そういうことですわ！\nおーっほっほっほっほっほ、ゲホッ、ゴホッ。", "zh": "就是这样！\n哦～呵呵呵呵呵、咳咳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fa754cded29112033dc5a804f7f073831c3922d8959b9784ad268b198c88af2e", "ja": "それでも、千鶴さんはアイドルになってくれた\nわけですから……感謝しないといけませんね。", "zh": "即使如此，千鹤还是成为了偶像……\n我得谢谢你才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "711522b133eb87c04aaf435294173cc359ad70b10d5ce4d50676f298bc31c656", "ja": "まあ、{$P$}。\nアイドルをおだてても、何も出ませんわよ？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。\n把偶像捧上天，也不会有什么奖赏喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "7a68b4d3f36d353c7615c6e12cea52e20a36304d5712e6bed8cf0199eb2f3279", "ja": "けどわたくしも、まさか自分がアイドルになるなんて、\n思ってもみませんでしたわ。", "zh": "不过，本小姐也没想到，\n自己居然会成为偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1012_038chz", "source_sha256": "830afe1df2d0a742bb547820c287f594d7699828efb3dd3c45b8b9b3834c3f94", "ja": "レッスンをしたり、アイドルとして\nステージに立って人前で歌ったり、ダンスしたり……。", "zh": "进行训练，然后以偶像身分站上舞台，\n在人前唱歌跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "902c8a77a2ff488f6395b1f069308752326e91b37c8c4e2854fd01fc14639bdb", "ja": "やる事はいろいろと変わりましたけど……わたくし\n自身は、あまり変わっていないのかもしれませんわね。", "zh": "虽然做的事情变了很多……\n但本小姐自己或许没有太大的变化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6955385b9fc86cc033f8139bec7a53fef8873cb908acd97642ff6cddaced0eb9", "ja": "そうなんですか？", "zh": "是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "ffab2386ea7028fbc5ad3d2270c55a4bd74720ab7bfdeff0a0e7677b48128d4b", "ja": "ええ。中学や高校の頃のわたくしも、今のわたくしも。\n学校では勉強をして、友人と話をして……。", "zh": "是啊，无论是国高中时期还是现在，本小姐都是一样的。\n在学校是念书、跟朋友聊天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "5b80e7747c164d86a7bca4b233bd5968f396d7c18d4911c07d510a90ed06b911", "ja": "劇場では仲間たちと過ごす、\n他愛のない日常を送っていますもの。", "zh": "在剧场则是和伙伴们共度，\n过着平凡无奇的日常生活。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2e4a975bbf3be845151c1032897f6f8cf4952487d7a2afcc23ab11cbc3921c24", "ja": "アイドルである事は、千鶴さんにとって\n日常になったんですね。それなら良かったです。", "zh": "当偶像对千鹤来说，已经是日常生活的一部分了啊。\n真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "0aff13aa956a905f838ebc82ac8f3298053e38e8a92a3d3bee5ae521ee532355", "ja": "きっと、そういうことですわね。アイドルになった\nおかげで、平凡な日常が楽しくなりましたわ♪", "zh": "肯定是这样没错吧。\n多亏当了偶像，平凡的日常生活也变得有趣了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "2727c45ba5ff99bb1bbc22f90414fb2a213aebe6494eea3302628d26f65260b0", "ja": "あっ。あ、あくまで学生としての話ですわよ！？\nその、社交界のわたくしではなく！", "zh": "啊！这、这只是以身为大学生来说喔！？\n呃，不代表社交界的本小姐的立场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_038chz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_038chz0123_1020_p", "source_sha256": "b0baca72bb945d1a9847642d27b308da4641474d9b5db816f910b2dc48672ab0", "ja": "（アイドルは千鶴さんの日常にすっかり溶け込んだ\nみたいだ。これからも楽しい仕事ができるといいな！）", "zh": "（偶像身分似乎已经彻底融入千鹤的日常生活了。\n希望她今后也能开心地工作！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
